OL,3,GNEWSAProtest against 'damaging'
OL,4,Achildren's health cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA protest against cuts to children's
OL,7,Fhealth services has been held outside
OL,8,Flocal authority headquarters.
OL,10,FAbout 50 people gathered at Endeavour
OL,11,FHouse office in Ipswich to campaign
OL,12,Fagainst Suffolk County Council's plan
OL,13,Fto make cuts to school nursing and
OL,14,Fsupport for teenage parents, despite
OL,15,Fthe council U-turning on proposals to
OL,16,Fremove community staff nurses from
OL,17,Fhealth visits.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
