OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtest against 'damaging'
OL,4,Achildren's health cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FCameron Matthews, regional organiser
OL,7,Ffor the union Unison, said the
OL,8,Fproposals, which are due to be signed
OL,9,Foff by the council's cabinet on
OL,10,FTuesday, would be "damaging to
OL,11,Fchildren's futures."
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the Reform UK-run
OL,14,Fcouncil said: "We respect the right of
OL,15,Fstaff, unions and residents to express
OL,16,Ftheir views."
